{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>An everlasting redemption shall be for the Levites.</b> Even though they are surrounded by a wall, they are not sold in perpetuity, because they have no other inheritance except the cities and their open lands, as it is written in the portion of Masei: ״והיו הערים להם לשבת ומגרשיהם יהיו לבהמתם ולרכושם ולכל חיתם״ (and the cities shall be theirs to dwell in, and their open lands shall be for their cattle and their property and for all their beasts)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:15.327887872Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}